          "id": "beeline-description",
          "type": "text",
          "heading": "",
          "text": "Beeline was trying to break out of heavy corporate bureaucracy, but many long-time employees no longer believed that real change was possible. We created an EVP platform that brought back a startup-like mindset: your ideas matter, your voice can move things forward, and the company is ready to help make them happen."
        },
        {
          "id": "beeline-role",
          "type": "text",
          "heading": "",
          "text": "My role: market and competitor analysis, EVP platform development, master slogan, direction-specific messaging and key visual ideas."
